  "document": "Way...Way Out\nWay ... Way Out is a 1966 American sex comedy film directed by Gordon Douglas and starring Jerry Lewis. It was distributed by 20th Century Fox and produced by Malcolm Stuart. The film, released on October 21, 1966, was both a critical and commercial flop, recouping less than half of its production budget."
